</item>
</list1>
</attention1>
<ptxt>
After removing / installing or replacing dual sensor brake support control module and/or windshield, perform 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0AAA16002">Dual Sensor Brake Support Control Module Aiming Adjustment:Dual Sensor Brake Support</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
